sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as Operator Controller Manager<br/>8081/TCP HTTP
    participant Helm as Helm Chart Renderer<br/>(embedded)
    participant RefGrant as ReferenceGrant<br/>(cross-ns authz)
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant GatewayAPI as Gateway API
    participant PromOp as prometheus-operator

    Note over User,PromOp: Reconciliation Flow (primary)

    User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update LLMBatchGateway CR<br/>(batch.llm-d.ai/v1alpha1)
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch event: LLMBatchGateway change
    Operator->>Helm: Render /charts/batch-gateway<br/>with CR spec values + pinned images
    Helm-->>Operator: Deployment manifests<br/>(API Server, Processor, GC)

    alt dispatchMode=async
        Operator->>Helm: Render /charts/async-processor<br/>with asyncConfig values
        Helm-->>Operator: Async Processor Deployment manifest
    end

    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployments<br/>(up to 4 per CR)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Services,<br/>ConfigMaps, ServiceAccounts

    Note over User,PromOp: Cross-Namespace Secret Sync

    alt spec.secretRef.namespace != CR namespace
        Operator->>K8sAPI: List ReferenceGrants<br/>in target namespace
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: ReferenceGrant list
        Operator->>RefGrant: Verify authorization<br/>for cross-ns Secret access
        RefGrant-->>Operator: Authorized
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Get Secret from<br/>source namespace
        K8sAPI-->>Operator: Secret data
        Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update<br/>&lt;gateway-name&gt;-credentials Secret<br/>in CR namespace
    end

    Note over User,PromOp: Gateway API & TLS Setup

    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoutes<br/>(gateway.networking.k8s.io)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Certificate CRs<br/>(cert-manager.io)
    CertMgr-->>K8sAPI: Issue TLS certificates

    Note over User,PromOp: Monitoring Pipeline (when POD_NAMESPACE set)

    Operator->>K8sAPI: Reconcile ServiceMonitors
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Reconcile PodMonitors
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Reconcile PrometheusRules
    PromOp-->>K8sAPI: Scrape operator & workload metrics

    Note over User,PromOp: Drift Detection (every 5m syncPeriod)

    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Periodic resync of owned resources
    Operator->>Operator: Compare desired vs actual state
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Patch drifted resources
